  "title": "primalucelib accepted calibration steps the controller refused in the parameter field",
  "description": "The SESTO SENSO 3 protocol v1.0 reports a refusal in the field of the parameter (\"Error: invalid parameter\"); the library only recognised ERROR keys, so CAL_FOCUSER steps and the CAL_DIR write were taken as done whatever the field said, and refused moves and syncs ended ALERT without the reason.\n\nImported from .factory/findings/archive/FND-20261023132326-3447-primaluce-field-errors-001.json (category: functional, blocking: no).",
